Package: RiemTS
Type: Package
Title: Time Series on Riemannian Manifolds
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Time series toolkit for data supported on Riemannian manifolds, 
    including a Riemannian factor model. A common interface (geodesic distance, 
    exponential/logarithm maps, Frechet mean, parallel transport) is provided 
    for data on various Riemannian manifolds, including Bures-Wasserstein and 
    Log-Euclidean manifolds of SPD matrices, the Grassmannian, and the sphere. 
License: MIT
